                                "sense_id": "9a900c10-9a16-38f4-9a83-d5508701bbbf",
                                "text": "[…] [the elevator] was in operation when it fell; its fall was due to the settling of the piers and the unsecure foundation of the elevator […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "340a646c-4dae-4e90-a911-734697c13235",
                                "sense_id": "9a900c10-9a16-38f4-9a83-d5508701bbbf",
                                "text": "In this chapter, you examine methods for encrypting data before it is sent across an unsecure network such as the Internet."
                            },
